    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d236-a1">

                <pb facs="0592" n="548" sameAs="frus:frus1946v03/pg548"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 1]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Suggested Programme</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center">(British)</p>
                <list>
                    <label>(1)</label>
                    <item>Commissions shall report to the Plenary not later than October 5th. Any
                        outstanding points on which by that date no vote has been possible shall be
                        referred to the Plenary for decision.</item>
                    <label>(2)</label>
                    <item>The Plenary shall vote on all reports or outstanding points by October
                        15th.</item>
                    <label>(3)</label>
                    <item>As much work as possible will be done in Paris before October 15th by the
                        Council of Foreign Ministers;</item>
                    <label>(4)</label>
                    <item>The remaining work will be finished by the Council of Foreign Ministers in
                        New York.</item>
                </list>
                <p>The programme suggested is as follows: <table cols="2" rows="7">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell>October 5th</cell>
                            <cell>Commissions end.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>October 5–15th</cell>
                            <cell>Plenary to consider reports of Commissions. Council of Foreign
                                Ministers meets to consider recommendations of Plenary as and when
                                adopted.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>October 15th</cell>
                            <cell>End of Conference.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>October 22nd</cell>
                            <cell>Deputies meet in New York, and prepare final Treaties.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>November 1–7th</cell>
                            <cell>Foreign Ministers meet in New York and take up Deputies’
                                work.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>November 15–20th</cell>
                            <cell>“Final stage” ends and Treaties are signed.</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>End of November</cell>
                            <cell>German talks begin.</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
            </div>
        </body>
